<programme start="20261109090000 +0000" stop="20261109120000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">SMU at Syracuse</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Syracuse Orange and the No. 19 SMU Mustangs meet at JMA Wireless Dome for an ACC matchup. SMU enters with a four-game win streak behind Kevin Jennings, while Syracuse broke a two-game skid with a 31-30 overtime win against North Carolina.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
