<programme start="20261111053200 +0000" stop="20261111063300 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Miel</sub-title><desc lang="es">Dwight y Sherry se asocian con un misterioso grupo de personas para acabar con Ginny. Cuando Morgan se ofrece, inesperadamente, a ayudar, se produce una lucha de poder.</desc><credits><director>Michael Satrazemis</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Craig Nigh</actor><actor>Devyn Tyler</actor></credits><date>20201108</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/1857193aa526f2d22c51105d8ed0d153b7060c37.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111063300 +0000" stop="20261111072300 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Sepultarla cerca de la pierna de Jasper</sub-title><desc lang="es">Hay una explosión en el campo petrolífero, y June intenta salvar la mayor cantidad de vidas posible. Sin embargo, la investigación de Virginia amenaza con arruinar el trabajo de June.</desc><credits><director>Sharat Raju</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Colby Minifie</actor><actor>Daryl Mitchell</actor><actor>Craig Nigh</actor></credits><date>20201115</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/2eb8345bab263f0516c61b806ec83a62889a2ae5.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111072300 +0000" stop="20261111082100 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Daños internos</sub-title><desc lang="es">Dakota desaparece, y Strand envía a Alicia y Charlie para que la busquen. Un aliado inesperado le brinda una nueva ruta de escape posible a Virginia.</desc><credits><director>Tawnia McKiernan</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Colby Minifie</actor><actor>Craig Nigh</actor></credits><date>20201122</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/5702859b3648ee96a3db018adfc1b9ec0355a8a0.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111082100 +0000" stop="20261111092000 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">La puerta</sub-title><desc lang="es">Una reunión con un viejo amigo ayuda a John Dorie a salir del estado de angustia en el que se encontraba. De vuelta en Lawton, Virginia exige respuestas.</desc><credits><director>Michael Satrazemis</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Daryl Mitchell</actor><actor>Colby Minifie</actor><actor>Craig Nigh</actor></credits><date>20210411</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/ac7dc33e91eb55db2f181df276ff6fdd0dd72c2d.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111092000 +0000" stop="20261111102100 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Cosas que quedan por hacer</sub-title><desc lang="es">Se produce un enfrentamiento entre Virginia, sus oficiales y el grupo de Morgan. Ginny se ganó muchos enemigos y finalmente deberá enfrentarlos.</desc><credits><director>Michael Satrazemis</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Cory Hart</actor><actor>Peter Jacobson</actor><actor>Colby Minifie</actor></credits><date>20210418</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.8.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E09</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/1e1ebbfcb4b970b7b5426442ee46444a27b8c736.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111102100 +0000" stop="20261111111400 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Tratar con cuidado</sub-title><desc lang="es">Morgan pide unidad y le asigna a Daniel la responsabilidad de mantener la paz. Sin embargo, este deberá superar sus propios desafíos si quiere proteger a sus amigos.</desc><credits><director>Heather Cappiello</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Cory Hart</actor><actor>Peter Jacobson</actor></credits><date>20210425</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.9.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E10</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/eb7d6e92e4ea8ebea595e4938272b94a6eb31e43.JPEG"/></programme>
