<programme start="20261109224903 +0000" stop="20261109231803 +0000" channel="Dora La Exploradora"><title lang="es">Dora The Explorer LT</title><sub-title lang="es">¡Salven a Diego!</sub-title><desc lang="es">El primo de Dora, Diego, protege a todos los animales de la selva. Pero al tratar de salvar a un pajarito bebé, Diego termina atrapado y ahora necesita nuestra ayuda. ¡No te preocupes, Diego!</desc><credits><actor>Ashley Fleming</actor><actor>Jake Burbage</actor><actor>Sasha Toro</actor><actor>Marc Weiner</actor><actor>Harrison Chad</actor><actor>Kathleen Herles</actor></credits><date>20040101</date><category lang="es">Children &amp; Family</category><category lang="es">Cartoons</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E07</episode-num><rating><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/654e4f4891ee7c001ad64f5d/tile_1783671842014.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
