<programme start="20261110160000 +0000" stop="20261110190000 +0000" channel="FS2 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Penn State at Washington</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Huskies (5-3, 2-3 Big Ten) try to solve the Nittany Lions (4-4, 1-4). Penn State has won all four meetings, the last a 35-6 decision in 2024. Both sides own double-digit victories over Purdue and one-score losses to No. 20 USC this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
