<programme start="20261110064900 +0000" stop="20261110071600 +0000" channel="Las Tortugas Ninja"><title lang="es">Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles LT</title><sub-title lang="es">La Venganza de los Tricératons</sub-title><desc lang="es">Donatello se siente inferior a Fugitoid, pero su inteligencia es puesta a prueba cuando los Triceratons atacan. La nave de Fugitoid está rodeada.</desc><credits><actor>Rob Paulsen</actor><actor>Greg Cipes</actor><actor>Sean Astin</actor></credits><date>20160101</date><category lang="es">Children &amp; Family</category><category lang="es">Cartoons</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.10.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E11</episode-num><rating><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/63ff6e23689edb0013bce4e7/tile_1769238721082.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
