<programme start="20261109210000 +0000" stop="20261109220000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">How Did They Fix That?</title><sub-title lang="en">Cirque Du Soleil: High-Flying Fixes</sub-title><desc lang="en">At Cirque du Soleil in Las Vegas, Mike embeds with the talented teams that maintain the amazing machines behind Cirque du Soleil&apos;s stage shows.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25005731_b_v8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
