<programme start="20261109230000 +0000" stop="20261110000000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">How Did They Fix That?</title><sub-title lang="en">UPS Worldport</sub-title><desc lang="en">Mike Davidson goes to the biggest automated package sorting facility in the world, UPS Worldport in Louisville, Kentucky; two million packages go through here every day.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25005731_b_v8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
