<programme start="20261109190000 +0000" stop="20261109220000 +0000" channel="Spectrum SportsNet LA"><title lang="en">Dodgers Rewind</title><sub-title lang="en">Cubs @ Dodgers</sub-title><desc lang="en">Yoshinobu Yamamoto pitched five scoreless innings, retiring 16 of his first 18 batters including eight strikeouts. Tommy Edman hit a three-run homer in the sixth. Tanner Scott pitched the ninth for his fourth save and the Dodgers beat the Cubs, 3-0.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Baseball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p11184787_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
